  m_Name: Faction_Covenant
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: KryticalNova.Runtime::KryticalNova.Factions.FactionDefinition
  id: 3
  displayName: Covenant
  tagline: Old enemies. One oath. Two fronts.
  lore: 'For centuries the clans and houses of the wildlands lived in balance with the land and with their dead, who returned to it. That ended when the Hegemony''s extraction reached their forests and fjords, strip-mining the terrain and catching the souls of their dead on the way home. Old enemies joined under one pact. Armed with primal elemental magic, runic weapons and guerrilla tactics, the Covenant fights to restore Nova''s cycle, protect the ancestral lands and let the dead find peace: striking at the Hegemony in front of it and holding off the Null behind it.'
